  "goodToKnow": "Der Abzug has many meanings, all from abziehen (to pull off): the withdrawal of troops, a deduction from pay (nach Abzug aller Kosten), the trigger of a gun (den Finger am Abzug), a photo print, and a kitchen extractor hood (der Dunstabzug). Punktabzug is a points deduction in a test. Plural: die Abzüge. In the vocabulary of the Cold War, der Abzug der Russen from East Germany ended in 1994."
